{"name": "Did You See That?", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras_big/737ac55d52751352e9d47c171f3006e2.webp?t=1788681175\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/737ac55d52751352e9d47c171f3006e2.webp?t=1788681175\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Not every player experiences the same world. Some anomalies appear to only one of you, while others can be seen by both. <strong>Compare what you see,</strong> question what you don't, and decide who to trust before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"456\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/b51b41061a7e2944f908f0242fb59518.poster.avif?t=1788681175\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/b51b41061a7e2944f908f0242fb59518.webm?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/b51b41061a7e2944f908f0242fb59518.mp4?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras_big/57037276e4a7e4ebe0804b0ade92f0fb.webp?t=1788681175\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/57037276e4a7e4ebe0804b0ade92f0fb.webp?t=1788681175\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings, remember the details and identify anomalies that defy reality. Every discovery forces a choice: Move forward or turn back. Make the right decision, because every mistake brings the nightmare closer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"456\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/f092d24cf868c3466e916790875c8f62.poster.avif?t=1788681175\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/f092d24cf868c3466e916790875c8f62.webm?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/f092d24cf868c3466e916790875c8f62.mp4?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras_big/65733063472584c9fdad1e3049453d54.webp?t=1788681175\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/65733063472584c9fdad1e3049453d54.webp?t=1788681175\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go deeper into bobby's carnival that  transforms when you make successful decisions. What begins as a forgotten ruin slowly twists into something disturbingly alive, where every new areas feels more unpredictable than before<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"456\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/916273bc6b43464562ae7ee27047c04a.poster.avif?t=1788681175\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/916273bc6b43464562ae7ee27047c04a.webm?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/916273bc6b43464562ae7ee27047c04a.mp4?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras_big/87549b7c8a6a0aaeb9153a116844f21d.webp?t=1788681175\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/87549b7c8a6a0aaeb9153a116844f21d.webp?t=1788681175\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too many mistakes could awaken Bobby. Most of the time the carnival stays quiet... until Bobby decides to appear. When he does, observation turns into panic as you're forced to survive his relentless pursuit.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"456\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/cf5f8eff54e38bfdf404a54c820cdb28.poster.avif?t=1788681175\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/cf5f8eff54e38bfdf404a54c820cdb28.webm?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/cf5f8eff54e38bfdf404a54c820cdb28.mp4?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras_big/41210a092991d3924f8f875259ea57da.webp?t=1788681175\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/41210a092991d3924f8f875259ea57da.webp?t=1788681175\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beneath all these illusions lies a story waiting to be discovered. Piece together forgotten memories, uncover the truth behind the carnival, and learn why Bobby wants you in this endless cycle...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"456\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/3faad748771295f41dcd839588d1704e.poster.avif?t=1788681175\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/3faad748771295f41dcd839588d1704e.webm?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/extras/3faad748771295f41dcd839588d1704e.mp4?t=1788681175\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A 2 Player psychological horror game where not every player sees the same reality. Explore a carnival trapped in an endless transformation, detect anomalies, verify with your friend if they see the same thing and make the right decisions before the clown Bobby loses his temper...", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830110/b1c8ca340456fe16c702f3ea6d0b338064149965/header.jpg?t=1788681175", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Online Co-Op", "Psychological Horror", "Exploration", "Walking Simulator", "Immersive Sim", "Simulation"], "developers": "Ashen Studios, IURAS Studios", "publishers": "Ashen Studios, IURAS Studios", "release_date": "October 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4830110", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/doNCX7SwV9M", "first_seen": 1788645600.0, "review_rank": 33}